{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51676","headline":"感降内夫人赐家室药物金器 · 钱弘俶","name":"感降内夫人赐家室药物金器","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鱼轩相逐拜龙轩，圣主俄推望外恩。\n锡宠便籓光石窌，内嫔迢递下金门。\n嵩衡压地何曾重，鸡犬昇仙未足论。\n臣憨已平难展报，只将忠孝训儿孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱弘俶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}